{"title":"인생 1000회차에서 살아남기","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=boGW3g/hAd4EnIRvd/GEnzxmQ19kdxIZV3FTYekK&filename=th3","synopsis":"하늘과 운명을 놓고 싸우는 수선계, 천 번의 삶을 향로로 태어난 남자 한진헌.\n남들의 수련 도구가 되어 정기를 빨아먹히고 죽은 것도 벌써 999번째였다.\n천 번의 삶마저 그렇게 끝나나 싶었을 때, 구원처럼 나타난 상태창.\n상태창의 도움으로 죽을 뻔한 위기에서 살아난 그는 자신의 체질에 대한 비밀을 풀기 위해 여정을 떠난다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":263,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":250,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":273,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":282,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":249,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-26","rank":298,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-20","rank":298,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-26","rank":297,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-29","rank":242,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":297127,"rc":599,"rs":5275,"cc":282},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":297146,"rc":600,"rs":5285,"cc":282},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":297160,"rc":600,"rs":5285,"cc":282},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":297179,"rc":600,"rs":5285,"cc":282},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":297186,"rc":601,"rs":5295,"cc":282},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":297191,"rc":601,"rs":5295,"cc":282},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":297207,"rc":601,"rs":5295,"cc":282},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":297231,"rc":602,"rs":5305,"cc":282},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":297245,"rc":602,"rs":5305,"cc":282},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":297286,"rc":602,"rs":5305,"cc":282},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":297294,"rc":603,"rs":5315,"cc":282},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":297305,"rc":603,"rs":5315,"cc":282},{"date":"2026-10-23","v":297322,"rc":603,"rs":5315,"cc":282},{"date":"2026-10-24","v":297325,"rc":604,"rs":5325,"cc":282},{"date":"2026-10-25","v":297336,"rc":604